2939350/extras/b59dae900be4ca031d7771285e9cbac5.webp?t=1755475208\" width=620 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello! We are a team of 5 core developers (+5 collab devs) aiming to create the best magical cat speedrunner in the world! We sincerely hope you enjoy our game, in whatever capacity that may be. Wanna chat with us? JOIN OUR DISCORD SERVER!! Thank you &lt;3   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>All social links are to the right of (PC) or above this description (Mobile).</i></p>",
